        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I can hardly see with all that mist around, but I can sense danger."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Told ye it would be no picnic excursion, elf-boy. Are ye lily-livered to continue?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Gentlemen, don’t squabble. We cannot go back now. But be watchful; I don’t like the feel of this country one bit."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I, too, feel we are in great danger."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Cleodil, stay close to me. If there is anything real behind this aura of dread, likely your keen senses will find it first and I will want to know what you discover immediately."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
